```text
$ cd packages/core && composer test
{"tool":"pest","result":"passed","tests":71,"passed":71,...}

$ composer test:pg -- --filter=OutboxAppend
{"tool":"pest","result":"passed","tests":1,"passed":1,...}

$ composer analyse
{"tool":"phpstan","result":"passed","errors":0}

$ composer lint:check
{"tool":"pint","result":"passed"}

$ rg -n '\bnow\(\)' packages/core/src/Messaging
packages/core/src/Messaging/Internal/SqlOutbox.php:41:        $now = $this->clock->now();
```

Единственный `now()` — инъектированный `ClockInterface` (D30), не глобальный хелпер Laravel.

Шесть случаев §5.3 — `OutboxAppendTest.php` (1–5) и `OutboxAppendPgTest.php` (откат).

```text
$ composer --working-dir=packages/core test:pg
{"tool":"pest","result":"passed","tests":36,"passed":36,"assertions":168,"duration_ms":36959}

$ composer --working-dir=packages/core test
{"tool":"pest","result":"passed","tests":84,"passed":84,"assertions":197,"duration_ms":2135}

$ composer --working-dir=packages/core analyse
{"tool":"phpstan","result":"passed","errors":0}

$ composer --working-dir=packages/core lint:check
{"tool":"pint","result":"passed"}

$ rg -n '\bnow\(\)' packages/core/src/Messaging
packages/core/src/Messaging/Commands/PruneOutboxMessages.php:43:        $now = $clock->now();
packages/core/src/Messaging/Internal/SqlInbox.php:34:            'processed_at' => $this->clock->now(),
packages/core/src/Messaging/Internal/SqlOutbox.php:41:        $now = $this->clock->now();
packages/core/src/Messaging/Internal/SqlOutboxRelay.php:36:        $now = $this->clock->now();
packages/core/src/Messaging/Internal/SqlOutboxRelay.php:125:        $now = $this->clock->now();
packages/core/src/Messaging/Internal/SqlOutboxRelay.php:149:        $now = $this->clock->now();
packages/core/src/Messaging/Internal/SqlOutboxRelay.php:185:                occurredAt: $this->clock->now(),
packages/core/src/Messaging/Internal/SqlDeliveryHealth.php:24:        $now = $this->clock->now();

$ rg --pcre2 -n '(?<!->)(?<!::)\bnow\(\)' packages/core/src/Messaging
(no matches; exit 1)
```

Буквальный smoke-поиск из item-spec не может быть пустым одновременно с обязательным D30: regex совпадает и с разрешённым `$clock->now()`. Все фактические совпадения идут через `ClockInterface`; уточнённый PCRE2-поиск глобального helper пуст.

